NON-COMMERCIAL USE DEFINITION
------------------------------
Use by a volunteer property management association (syndic bénévole), a
residents' association, or an individual for personal property management
qualifies as non-commercial use and is covered by the AGPL-3.0 at no charge.

================================================================================
COMMERCIAL LICENSE (required for professional use)
================================================================================

Use of La Ruche by a professional property manager (syndic professionnel, as
defined by article 9 of French law n°70-9 du 2 janvier 1970, holder of a
carte professionnelle G) or any organization that charges fees for property
management services requires a separate commercial license.

See LICENSE-COMMERCIAL for terms and contact information.

